WEBVTT

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.980
A new place where I belong.

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:07.900
A place that has the kind people I love.

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:11.940
But something inside me is still hesitating.

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:16.200
I’m sure it’s because I’m scared of myself.

00:00:17.090 --> 00:00:22.120
Together with my combat partners and my seniors who give it their best,

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:26.540
I’m sure they wish for
the same things I do because they’re kind.

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:33.930
I can’t hesitate anymore,
since I have decided on this path that I’ll be walking.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:39.560
Magical Girl Lyrical Nanoha StrikerS<i>
will now begin.</i>

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:49.130
Dragon summoner of Alzus, child of Lushe, Caro!

00:02:49.130 --> 00:02:53.280
At only the age of six, to have a Flying Silver Dragon,

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:56.570
you’ve surrendered to the dark energy’s current.

00:02:56.570 --> 00:03:00.790
You are indeed a wonderful dragon summoner.

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:06.650
However, a power too strong will lead to nothing but conflict and despair.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:14.870
We are sorry. You can stay in this village no longer.

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:21.960
Dragon summoners hold a dangerous power.

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:30.330
A frightening power that can hurt people.

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:49.260
The target railcar is travelling at a velocity of 70 units and rising.

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:53.000
It seems they haven’t penetrated the important-goods container yet.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.780
It’s just a matter of time.

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:58.650
Alto, Lucino, perform a smart scan!

00:03:58.650 --> 00:04:00.050
Search towards the sky!

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:02.620
Gadget responses? From the sky?

00:04:02.620 --> 00:04:05.220
Aerial types appear to be coming to aid local units!

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:10.440
This is Fate. Griffith, I’ve just arrived at a parking lot.

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:13.260
I’ll park the car and go to the scene. Please give me flight clearance.

00:04:13.260 --> 00:04:16.680
Roger. City airspace has been closed for
the rest of the morning: clearance approved.

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:24.360
Vice, I’m going too.

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:26.940
Along with Captain Fate, the two of us will clear the sky.

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:29.960
Okay! Nanoha, please do!

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:32.230
Main hatch, open.

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:36.170
Well then, I’ll be going out for a while.

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:39.240
Everyone, do your best, and beat them decisively!

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:41.240
Yes, ma’am!

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:41.780
Caro.

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:45.680
It’s okay. You don’t need to be so nervous.

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:50.180
Even if we’re apart, we are connected through comms,

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:51.630
so you’re not alone.

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:54.100
If you get into trouble, I’ll save you.

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:57.620
Caro, your magic can protect everyone.

00:04:57.620 --> 00:05:01.510
It’s a strong, gentle power, right?

00:05:03.560 --> 00:05:05.380
Get set.

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:12.540
Bardiche Assault.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:14.160
<b>Set up!</b>

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:15.050
Set up.

00:05:39.090 --> 00:05:41.800
Barrier Jacket: Impulse Form

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:01.090
Let’s go, Bardiche.

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:01.930
Yes, sir.

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:09.240
Lightning 1, Fate Testarossa-Harlaown,
heading out!

00:06:20.200 --> 00:06:22.380
Standby, ready.

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:24.180
Raising Heart.

00:06:24.180 --> 00:06:25.840
<b>Set up!</b>

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:02.000
Barrier Jacket: Aggressor Mode

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:22.770
Accel Fin

00:07:23.800 --> 00:07:27.160
Stars 1, Nanoha Takamachi, heading out!

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:36.610
There are two objectives: destroy all enemy Gadgets to prevent their escape, and safely secure the Relic.

00:07:36.610 --> 00:07:39.340
Therefore, Stars Squad and Lightning Squad,

00:07:39.340 --> 00:07:44.480
in your pairs, proceed to destroy Gadgets from both ends of the railcar and rendezvous at the center car.

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:48.500
The Relic is here, within the No. 7
important-goods container.

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:53.160
Stars or Lightning, whoever arrives first, will secure the Relic.

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:54.060
Yes, ma’am!

00:07:54.060 --> 00:07:54.890
And!

00:07:57.980 --> 00:08:02.210
I’ll also be at the scene to observe and give commands.

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:05.130
Stars 1, Lightning 1, engaging.

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:10.160
We’ll cover the airspace here. Please follow the new recruits.

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:11.070
Roger.

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:14.690
It’s been a while since we’ve shared
the same sky, hasn’t it, Fate?

00:08:14.690 --> 00:08:15.550
Yeah, Nanoha.

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:42.810
Accel Shooter

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:52.920
Haken Form

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:06.330
Well then, newbies!

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:12.330
Thanks to your captains establishing air superiority,
we’ve made it to the drop point safely.

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:13.630
Are you ready?

00:09:13.630 --> 00:09:14.320
Yes, sir!

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:17.020
Stars 3, Subaru Nakajima!

00:09:17.020 --> 00:09:19.790
Stars 4, Teana Lanster!

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:20.990
Heading out!

00:09:24.070 --> 00:09:26.250
Let’s go, Mach Caliber.

00:09:27.610 --> 00:09:30.800
I’m counting on you, Cross Mirage.

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:31.980
<b>Set up!</b>

00:09:32.120 --> 00:09:33.410
Standby, ready.

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:51.380
Lightning, you’re next!

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:53.430
You kids be careful!

00:10:53.430 --> 00:10:54.250
Yes, sir!

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:57.740
Do you want to go together?

00:11:03.440 --> 00:11:04.220
Yes!

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:08.370
Lightning 3, Erio Mondial!

00:11:08.370 --> 00:11:11.980
Lightning 4, Caro Ru Lushe and Friedrich!

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:13.960
Heading out!

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:17.500
Strada!

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:18.720
Kerykeion!

00:11:18.720 --> 00:11:20.430
<b>Set up!</b>

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:21.230
Huh?

00:12:21.230 --> 00:12:23.180
Hey, this Jacket is...

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:24.930
Don’t tell me!

00:12:24.930 --> 00:12:29.950
Their designs and capabilities
are modelled after each squad’s captain.

00:12:29.950 --> 00:12:32.530
They might be a bit uncommon, but they’re highly efficient.

00:12:36.450 --> 00:12:38.290
Subaru, you can be impressed later!

00:12:43.890 --> 00:12:46.180
Drive Ignition

00:12:46.180 --> 00:12:48.060
Variable Barret

00:12:49.110 --> 00:12:50.540
Shoot!

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:09.070
Absorb Grip

00:13:11.660 --> 00:13:13.070
<b>Revolver...</b>

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:15.960
<b>...Shoot</b>

00:13:20.600 --> 00:13:22.050
Wingroad

00:13:31.400 --> 00:13:36.830
Mach Caliber, you’re—are you really that amazing?

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:42.410
Your acceleration and grip control,
for example, and you can even make a Wingroad!

00:13:42.410 --> 00:13:47.160
Because I was made to make you run stronger and faster.

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:53.770
But, Mach Caliber, you have an A.I. or soul, right?

00:13:54.550 --> 00:13:56.580
Then your thinking’s a little wrong.

00:13:59.970 --> 00:14:05.270
You were born so you could run together <i>with</i> me.

00:14:05.270 --> 00:14:07.800
That means the same thing to me.

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:10.600
That’s just all kinds of not right!

00:14:13.650 --> 00:14:15.640
I’ll think about it.

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:34.810
Teana, how’s the situation looking?

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:38.390
It’s looking bad! Destroying the cables has no effect.

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:42.060
Roger. I’ll take over stopping the train.

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:44.490
Teana, please regroup with Subaru.

00:14:44.490 --> 00:14:45.340
Roger!

00:14:45.340 --> 00:14:46.990
One-Hand Mode

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:51.730
But still, it’s as expected of the newest model.

00:14:51.730 --> 00:14:55.940
I bet you’re good for all kinds of things...
you can even help with forming shots, can’t you?

00:14:55.940 --> 00:14:57.980
Yes. Was it unnecessary?

00:14:59.180 --> 00:15:03.510
Relying on someone as good as you
doesn’t go down well with me,

00:15:04.680 --> 00:15:06.630
but it helps in live combat.

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:07.410
Thank you.

00:15:10.390 --> 00:15:12.710
Stars F, advancing at car number 4.

00:15:12.710 --> 00:15:15.260
Lightning F, currently in combat at car number 10.

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:18.950
Stars 1, Lightning 1 have gained air superiority.

00:15:18.950 --> 00:15:20.940
Gadgets Type 2 are scattering.

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:22.830
Commencing support and pursuit.

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:26.570
Sorry for the long wait.

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:28.210
Commander Yagami!

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:29.350
Welcome back.

00:15:29.350 --> 00:15:31.440
So far, everything has proceeded smoothly.

00:15:32.480 --> 00:15:35.910
Lightning F has infiltrated car number 8.

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:41.690
Encounter! It’s the new model!

00:15:51.210 --> 00:15:52.330
Fried!

00:15:52.330 --> 00:15:53.480
<b>Blast Flare</b>

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:58.020
Fire!

00:16:09.040 --> 00:16:11.030
It’s tough!

00:16:18.480 --> 00:16:19.750
An A.M.F.?

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:21.350
Even this far away?

00:16:33.610 --> 00:16:35.410
Don’t worry! Leave it to me.

00:16:54.980 --> 00:17:01.700
She certainly does have some tremendous powers,
but she can’t control them very well.

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:03.280
Even with her dragon summoning,

00:17:03.280 --> 00:17:07.380
the dragon that’s supposed to protect her
has just been running wild.

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:11.640
It’s more than awful:
she honestly can’t work in any units.

00:17:11.640 --> 00:17:15.950
At most, she can handle solo missions for annihilation.

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:20.480
Thank you for your concerns.

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:21.480
Well then.

00:17:21.480 --> 00:17:25.560
No, as I already planned, I’ll take her into my care.

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:40.390
Where do I have to go this time?

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:46.540
That depends on where you want to go
and what you want to do.

00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:51.120
Caro, where do you want to go, and what do you want to do?

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:59.280
I’d never even thought about it.

00:17:59.280 --> 00:18:07.470
In front of me were always places I couldn’t go
and things I couldn’t do... nothing else.

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:40.160
Erio.

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:44.810
Lightning 4 jumped off!

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:48.910
Wait, those two, to jump off
and attempt rescue from that height...

00:18:48.910 --> 00:18:50.220
No, she’s doing <i>that</i>.

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:53.210
I see!

00:18:53.210 --> 00:18:57.990
That’s right! If you get away from the source, the A.M.F. will weaken.

00:18:57.990 --> 00:19:01.100
She can use her magic’s full performance!

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:04.660
I want to protect them.

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:06.050
Everyone who’s been nice to me.

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:09.980
The people who smile at me.

00:19:11.510 --> 00:19:13.220
With my own power,

00:19:13.220 --> 00:19:14.190
I want to protect them!

00:19:15.890 --> 00:19:17.500
Drive Ignition

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:30.350
Fried, sorry for keeping you sealed.

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:33.560
I’ll control you properly.

00:19:33.560 --> 00:19:35.050
Let’s go!

00:19:35.050 --> 00:19:37.000
Summoning dragon spirit!

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:43.070
White spirit that traverses the blue sky,

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:45.860
become my wings to reach the skies above!

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:52.480
Come forth, my dragon Friedrich. ’Tis the time!

00:19:52.480 --> 00:19:54.520
<b>Summoning Dragon Spirit</b>

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:05.610
Summoning successful!

00:20:05.610 --> 00:20:09.470
Fried’s consciousness level is blue!
State is completely under control.

00:20:09.470 --> 00:20:10.860
This is...!

00:20:10.860 --> 00:20:15.420
That’s right, Caro’s dragon summoning, her greatest power.

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:16.750
That’s...!

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:18.840
That little dragon’s true form?

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.780
Sweet!

00:20:25.790 --> 00:20:27.230
S-Sorry!

00:20:27.230 --> 00:20:30.470
Uh, m-me too.

00:20:30.470 --> 00:20:34.590
Those two won’t need rescuing anymore.

00:20:34.590 --> 00:20:37.400
Well then, let’s retrieve the Relic.

00:20:41.560 --> 00:20:42.510
Fried!

00:20:42.510 --> 00:20:43.990
<b>Blast Ray</b>

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:48.590
Fire!

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:55.760
It’s tough after all.

00:20:55.760 --> 00:20:59.140
Because it’s the source of that field,
bombardment attacks won’t have any effect.

00:20:59.140 --> 00:21:01.080
Strada and I will do it.

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:05.350
O sword of justice, heed my faithful cry.

00:21:05.350 --> 00:21:08.560
Bestow your blessed light on this knight’s lance.

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:11.440
Enchant: Field Invade

00:21:11.440 --> 00:21:15.120
O light of prayer, grant strength unto thy arms.

00:21:15.120 --> 00:21:17.080
Boost Up: Strike Power

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:19.420
Let’s go, Erio.

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:20.750
Roger, Caro!

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:26.720
<b>Twin Boost: Slash & Strike</b>

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:30.830
Received.

00:21:33.690 --> 00:21:34.830
Steel Knife

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:39.620
Explosion

00:21:43.430 --> 00:21:44.950
<b>Flash Hit</b>

00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:57.420
We did it!

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:04.790
No Gadget responses on the train
or anywhere else. They’ve all been destroyed!

00:22:04.790 --> 00:22:08.050
Stars F, we’ve safely secured the Relic.

00:22:08.050 --> 00:22:12.300
The train is under control as well. Stopping it now!

00:22:13.480 --> 00:22:18.480
Well, while you’re at it, Rein, why don’t you and the three Stars board the helicopter

00:22:18.480 --> 00:22:22.860
and then continue to escort the Relic all the way to the central region.

00:22:22.860 --> 00:22:23.930
Yes indeedy!

00:22:23.930 --> 00:22:25.780
What about Lightning?

00:22:25.780 --> 00:22:30.230
Stand by at the scene,
and let the operatives deal with the cleanup.

00:22:30.230 --> 00:22:31.740
I’ll leave it to you.

00:22:43.920 --> 00:22:47.440
Serial No. IX has entered the convoy.

00:22:49.690 --> 00:22:51.760
Shall we issue a pursuit order?

00:22:51.760 --> 00:22:55.050
Let’s not. I want the Relic,

00:22:55.050 --> 00:22:57.990
but to have been able to just take
the girls’ data was more than enough.

00:22:59.230 --> 00:23:04.150
Even so, these subjects are wonderful, as expected.

00:23:04.800 --> 00:23:09.400
On top of being items of great interest for my research,

00:23:11.480 --> 00:23:17.260
to have a chance of obtaining these children,

00:23:17.260 --> 00:23:20.160
the living, breathing remnants of Project F...

00:25:17.980 --> 00:25:19.500
Following our
first deployment,

00:25:19.500 --> 00:25:21.410
our daily training
has been kicked up a notch.

00:25:21.410 --> 00:25:27.380
And the incident is being unveiled little by little from the battlefield.

00:25:33.140 --> 00:25:35.210
Take off!
